        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "8. Earned vacation is payable upon separation providing the employee has completed six (6) months of service and has given the required two (2) weeks notice. If an employee's last day of work falls on or before the fifteenth (15th) of the month, there is no vacation credit for that month. If the employee's last day of work falls after the fifteenth (15th), he/she receives vacation for that month. Vacation due upon separation is calculated on the number of completed months service since September 1 plus any unused vacation from the prior year which the employee was authorized to carry over.",
